{"data":[{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-01-17T12:00:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1747589735810507125"],"id":"1747589735810507125","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4095,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"刚刚在和家里打电话\n我爹竟然说 我是他和我妈的骄傲\n我： 我吗？ 是我这个大废物吗？\n我配吗家人？？？？\n是我吗 \n可以说是真正的受宠若惊了\n（虽然他俩一直都这样说  每次听都还是很震惊）\n我本人哪有什么优点啊…………\n这就是父母滤镜吗家人们","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1747589735810507125"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-01-16T07:05:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1747153071686484087"],"id":"1747153071686484087","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3992,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我今天的计划\n剪头\n拿耳机\n铲\n收行李\n铲铲铲铲铲铲铲铲铲铲铲铲铲铲铲铲铲铲铲铲铲铲\n凌晨五点睡觉","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1747153071686484087"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-01-16T06:02:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1747137150406234615"],"id":"1747137150406234615","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3808,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"止痛药舍友的\n消炎药隔壁的\n哥们活着全靠接济😋","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1747137150406234615"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-01-16T02:16:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1747080312872677656"],"id":"1747080312872677656","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3829,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我要把这个屌世界全都干翻\n捏妈的昨天疼的最厉害的时候火速买了机票\n结果今天不疼了\n操你妈的又想改签了……………………\n干嘛啊！！！！！\n（虽然如此还是别疼的好 谢谢🙏\n睡不着了有点儿","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1747080312872677656"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-01-16T01:31:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1747068956719075523"],"id":"1747068956719075523","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3754,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今天没疼！！！！\n哇\n太幸福了吧咱说\n一觉睡到现在\n嘎嘎爽\n（起来拉粑","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1747068956719075523"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-01-15T17:44:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1746951627456790938"],"id":"1746951627456790938","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4067,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"坏消息：耳骨钉发炎了\n更坏的消息：另一个耳洞也发炎了\n更更坏的消息：腰疼变严重了","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1746951627456790938"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-01-15T13:42:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1746890703316406526"],"id":"1746890703316406526","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3709,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"嗨嗨嗨\n买了19号的票\n多病留子爆改村头敦实二丫","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1746890703316406526"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-01-15T00:11:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1746686434197848563"],"id":"1746686434197848563","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3713,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"九点冒头\n准时疼醒\n好好好 好好好好好好\n甚至已经习惯疼醒了我\n真几把疼操你妈的","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1746686434197848563"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-01-14T11:04:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1746488503599550830"],"id":"1746488503599550830","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3331,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"又疼上了\n你妈个逼的\n洗了算了","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1746488503599550830"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-01-14T09:22:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1746462670289822061"],"id":"1746462670289822061","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3400,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"睁眼第一顿是br的俩冰淇淋球\n别管我了\n人不会轻易死掉的","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1746462670289822061"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-01-14T04:18:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1746386230143864996"],"id":"1746386230143864996","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3291,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我靠\n有点严重了\n我一晚上腰疼醒两次\n这会儿也是疼醒的\n现在疼的坐不住\n莫非真的要早点回家了\n主要是这俩月你妈的没交保险\n看病没法在这报销啊\n我他妈真的很抠门","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1746386230143864996"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-01-13T19:54:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1746259375440990325"],"id":"1746259375440990325","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3504,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"刚刚看了一下账单\n说起来有点恐怖\n我一个星期花了8k左右\n其实主要是买了一块表和一个耳机这就6k了\n这是能看得着的东西算是大头\n那么问题来了\n剩下的2k 花去哪里了\n我每天点一顿外卖吃两顿\n看病也才花了200\n我的钱\n到底\n去哪里了？？？？？？\n回国要带的东西还都没买\n钱呢？\n我还想买衣服呢\n钱呢？？？","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1746259375440990325"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-01-13T08:10:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1746082160610857105"],"id":"1746082160610857105","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3325,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"操你妈的Brooklyn 99\n给我整哭了\n也太好看了操你妈的\n呜呜呜呜呜呜呜呜呜呜呜呜爱死了","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1746082160610857105"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-01-12T15:39:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1745832876254326978"],"id":"1745832876254326978","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3190,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"看完泽的直播\n半个小时没缓过来\n我真的爱上泽的了\n谢谢你 大发明家陈伟","url":"https://x.com/HnrBB2nai/status/1745832876254326978"},{"author_id":"1229453490537107457","created_at":"2024-01-10T17:30:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1745136065722396849"],"id":"1745136065722396849","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3123,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_coun